{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s31abb35a94dac2ca","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-e77b0517dc55f210c7d5","text":"合成マシンが爆発した？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4c12636efcd1dda0973a","text":"合成マシンが爆発した？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cb170f936ecd6c9be20f","text":"ただの「不味いチャーハン」だよ。爆発なんてしないってば","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f7561c5b81a81d791401","text":"部屋のドアが開かなくなった？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-afa7a82ffff7df5bbe13","text":"部屋のドアが開かなくなった？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6026f8723e261c18f83d","text":"もし本当にそんなことが起きたら、『星穹列車七不思議』を書き始めないと","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0c6370453b4380d2bbd7","text":"パムが見つからない{M#のか}{F#の}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-dd0b6186018a1a60ce27","text":"パムが見つからない{M#のか}{F#の}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3dd0a49a239bcbd781de","text":"車掌さんが見つからない列車って怖すぎる…想像もしたくない！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3195238705725d3b8776","text":"ていうか、なんでそんな反応するの\nヽ(｀Д´#)ﾉ","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-534af091b01dc5dab113","text":"ウチはアンタが何をやってるのか聞きたかっただけなんだけど！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-62402f607c48f1025683","text":"花萼の周回！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-200942c078b0d35a3cc9","text":"花萼の周回！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a6382087be34250347f9","text":"そうなんだ…調子は？いい感じ？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4190b5a2c28396242e41","text":"信用ポイント？それとも光円錐のほう？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7a9f2e0881dc0a01138a","text":"[開拓者]は本当に頑張るね～","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f31618699bb1c89ceb75","text":"ウチの力は必要？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e3dc4c7d54ce6f36c50","text":"オッケー、今から行くね！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-305b4ace6a5e1c590fc5","text":"依頼をこなしてる！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-17058316ea23c3696e3c","text":"依頼をこなしてる！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0ab9c40100a8656c3c48","text":"わお…働き者だね…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0158cc107b4711cfc3a2","text":"[開拓者]ってば、もう一人前のナナシビトじゃん","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c92f824dac9c118a88c1","text":"もし面白そうな依頼があったら、ウチのことも呼んでね！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c65037253a437ad99504","text":"その…何もしてない！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-266eaa43a1a1071cb79f","text":"その…何もしてない！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0898e9612982b954b4be","text":"はあ…そんなに暇なんだ","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ac75835d64ab061d201b","text":"そんなに暇なのに、どうして列車に戻らないの？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7eebbd09e72eee4de863","text":"ウチとおしゃべりしようよ～","speaker":""}]}
